{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Laravel 12 Service Provider Management",
  "description": "Service provider creation and registration workflow for Laravel 12",
  "version": "2.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileCreated",
    "patterns": ["app/Providers/*.php"]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Service provider has been created! Please guide through Laravel 12 service provider management:\n\n1. **Registration**: Register in bootstrap/providers.php\n2. **Register Method**: Use register() method for service bindings and container registrations\n3. **Boot Method**: Use boot() method for bootstrapping and configuration\n4. **Deferred Providers**: Implement deferred providers for performance optimization\n5. **Dependency Injection**: Add proper dependency injection in constructor\n6. **Service Aliases**: Configure service aliases for easier access\n7. **Configuration Validation**: Add configuration validation in boot method\n8. **Error Handling**: Implement proper error handling and logging\n\nRun `php artisan about` to verify provider registration and application status."
  }
}